{"4591490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fun Road", "steam_appid": 4591490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUN ROAD</strong> is a cooperative off-road game for two players, where the road to the finish line turns into a funny test of teamwork, patience, and the ability not to flip over at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player becomes the <strong>driver</strong> and tries to keep the car under control. The second is the <strong>navigator</strong>, who helps watch the road, gives directions, and helps out when everything goes off plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=1080 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car here is not a perfect simulation off-roader. It is clumsy, heavy, funny, and unpredictable. It can bounce on rocks, get stuck, flip over, roll down a slope, or suddenly put you in a situation that you will have to get out of together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperation where both players matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The driver does not see everything and does not always understand what lies ahead. The navigator helps with orientation, warns about dangers, and tells where to drive next. To reach the finish line, you will have to communicate, argue, make mistakes, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest, slopes, rocks, and dangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path goes through an uneven low-poly location with climbs, descents, rocks, forest sections, and narrow passages. Sometimes the main problem is the road. Sometimes it is your car. And sometimes it is what lives in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the bear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can encounter a bear in the forest. It patrols the area, notices players, and can start chasing them. If the situation becomes dangerous, use the signal flare — it can scare the animal away and give you a chance to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/793ac52002d0238bdc72981d32d4e848.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/793ac52002d0238bdc72981d32d4e848.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/793ac52002d0238bdc72981d32d4e848.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main thing is to reach the finish together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: drive to the finish line. But the way there will be full of small disasters, funny mistakes, and moments you will want to tell someone about after the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/6c65086c58e1407ca2128c065da19252.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/6c65086c58e1407ca2128c065da19252.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/6c65086c58e1407ca2128c065da19252.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUN ROAD</strong> does not try to be a serious driving simulator. It is a game about cooperative chaos, clumsy physics, a forest adventure, and an attempt to prove that two people can still get the car to the end of the route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player cooperation: driver and navigator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clumsy off-road car that is easy to lose control of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging terrain: slopes, rocks, forest roads, and narrow passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny rollovers, getting stuck, and physics-based situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A signal flare that helps scare away the bear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An AI bear that patrols the location and reacts to players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple goal: reach the finish together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a hike, a forest, and a chaotic off-road adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a simulator, but a fun cooperative off-road challenge.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUN ROAD</strong> is a cooperative off-road game for two players, where the road to the finish line turns into a funny test of teamwork, patience, and the ability not to flip over at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player becomes the <strong>driver</strong> and tries to keep the car under control. The second is the <strong>navigator</strong>, who helps watch the road, gives directions, and helps out when everything goes off plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=1080 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/b5c5863cd84c52cc640bd874c5b07a7e.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car here is not a perfect simulation off-roader. It is clumsy, heavy, funny, and unpredictable. It can bounce on rocks, get stuck, flip over, roll down a slope, or suddenly put you in a situation that you will have to get out of together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperation where both players matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The driver does not see everything and does not always understand what lies ahead. The navigator helps with orientation, warns about dangers, and tells where to drive next. To reach the finish line, you will have to communicate, argue, make mistakes, and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.poster.avif?t=1782818253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.webm?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/0271d889442961414150e692286c5866.mp4?t=1782818253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest, slopes, rocks, and dangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path goes through an uneven low-poly location with climbs, descents, rocks, forest sections, and narrow passages. Sometimes the main problem is the road. Sometimes it is your car. And sometimes it is what lives in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the bear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can encounter a bear in the forest. It patrols the area, notices players, and can start chasing them. If the situation becomes dangerous, use the signal flare — it can scare the animal away and give you a chance to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591490/extras/793ac52002d0238bdc72981d32d4e848.pos